chen:p004","quote":"伯"}]},{"id":"cbr-p003420","label":"陳平嫂（陳丞相世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"嫂","mention_ids":["c-shiji-056-chen:m001-0071"]},{"surface":"其婦","mention_ids":["c-shiji-056-chen:m001-0106"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m001-0071","chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p001","quote":"嫂"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m001-0106","chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p001","quote":"其婦"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m001-0032","start":32,"end":33,"surface":"伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003419","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p001","chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m001-0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003419","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p001","chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m001-0101","start":101,"end":102,"surface":"伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003419","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p001","chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m002-0235","start":235,"end":236,"surface":"伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003419","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p002","chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m004-0039","start":39,"end":40,"surface":"伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003419","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p004","chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-shiji056-001","subject_person_id":"cbr-p003419","predicate":"brother","object_person_id":"cbr-p003418","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen","source_id":"s-shiji-056-chen","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p001","quote":"陳丞相平者，陽武戸牖鄕人也。少時家貧，好讀書，有田三十畝，獨與兄伯居。伯常耕田，縱平使遊學。平爲人長美色。人或謂陳平曰：「貧何食而肥若是？」其嫂嫉平之不視家生產，曰：「亦食糠覈耳。有叔如此，不如無有。」伯聞之，逐其婦而棄之。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"獨與兄伯居","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"按明示兄、婦、娶、女孫、子、母、女弟與曾孫保存。女孫不推父為張仲，曾孫不作直接子，不補中間世代或同父同母；後段勸語及盜嫂指控的嫂未硬接首段伯婦。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"a-shiji056-002","subject_person_id":"cbr-p003419","predicate":"spouse","object_person_id":"cbr-p003420","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen","source_id":"s-shiji-056-chen","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p001","quote":"陳丞相平者，陽武戸牖鄕人也。少時家貧，好讀書，有田三十畝，獨與兄伯居。伯常耕田，縱平使遊學。平爲人長美色。人或謂陳平曰：「貧何食而肥若是？」其嫂嫉平之不視家生產，曰：「亦食糠覈耳。有叔如此，不如無有。」伯聞之，逐其婦而棄之。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"伯聞之，逐其婦而棄之","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"按明示兄、婦、娶、女孫、子、母、女弟與曾孫保存。女孫不推父為張仲，曾孫不作直接子，不補中間世代或同父同母；後段勸語及盜嫂指控的嫂未硬接首段伯婦。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji056-002","person_id":"cbr-p003419","surfaces":["伯"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-056-chen"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p001","quote":"陳丞相平者，陽武戸牖鄕人也。少時家貧，好讀書，有田三十畝，獨與兄伯居。伯常耕田，縱平使遊學。平爲人長美色。人或謂陳平曰：「貧何食而肥若是？」其嫂嫉平之不視家生產，曰：「亦食糠覈耳。有叔如此，不如無有。」伯聞之，逐其婦而棄之。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p002","quote":"及平長，可娶妻，富人莫肯與者，貧者平亦恥之。久之，戸牖富人有張負，張負女孫五嫁而夫輒死，人莫敢娶。平欲得之。邑中有喪，平貧，侍喪，以先往後罷爲助。張負既見之喪所，獨視偉平，平亦以故後去。負隨平至其家，家乃負郭窮巷，以弊席爲門，然門外多有長者車轍。張負歸，謂其子仲曰：「吾欲以女孫予陳平。」張仲曰：「平貧不事事，一縣中盡笑其所爲，獨奈何予女乎？」負曰：「人固有好美如陳平而長貧賤者乎？」卒與女。爲平貧，乃假貸幣以聘，予酒肉之資以內婦。負誡其孫曰：「毋以貧故，事人不謹。事兄伯如事父，事嫂如母。」平既娶張氏女，齎用益饒，遊道日廣。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p004","quote":"陳渉起而王陳，使周市略定魏地，立魏咎爲魏王，與秦軍相攻於臨濟。陳平固已前謝其兄伯，從少年往事魏王咎於臨濟。魏王以爲太僕。説魏王不聽，人或讒之，陳平亡去。"}],"rationale":"依本篇明示名字、局部主語、授官爵與家世暫接。平城與負郭不作短名，韓王信與淮陰侯韓信、審食其與酈食其分開。上依高帝與孝文帝敘事換主語，指控與古代比擬不當已驗史實；未名者不補全名，女孫父親不由婚議推定。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p001","text":"陳丞相平者，陽武戸牖鄕人也。少時家貧，好讀書，有田三十畝，獨與兄伯居。伯常耕田，縱平使遊學。平爲人長美色。人或謂陳平曰：「貧何食而肥若是？」其嫂嫉平之不視家生產，曰：「亦食糠覈耳。有叔如此，不如無有。」伯聞之，逐其婦而棄之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m001-0000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"陳丞相平","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003418","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m001-0032","start":32,"end":33,"surface":"伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003419","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m001-0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003419","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m001-0041","start":41,"end":42,"surface":"平","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003418","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m001-0046","start":46,"end":47,"surface":"平","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003418","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m001-0053","start":53,"end":54,"surface":"人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、泛稱官職、氏族或代詞待覆核，不補姓名或未見家屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m001-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"陳平","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003418","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m001-0071","start":71,"end":72,"surface":"嫂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003420","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m001-0073","start":73,"end":74,"surface":"平","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003418","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m001-0091","start":91,"end":92,"surface":"叔","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、泛稱官職、氏族或代詞待覆核，不補姓名或未見家屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m001-0101","start":101,"end":102,"surface":"伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003419","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m001-0106","start":106,"end":108,"surface":"其婦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003420","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen","book_id":"b-shiji-056","work_id":